  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a la consolidacin del sector Salud y Seguridad Social</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of the consolidation of health and social security sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">(i) Implementar la separacin de funciones de rectoria y de provision del sector salud; (ii) Reordenamiento del Instituto Dominicano de Seguridad Social (IDSS); (iii) Apoyar la gestion por resultados del sector salud; (iv) Eliminacion del Regimen Contributivo-Subsidiado; (v) Definir las prioridades del GORD en el area de salud en los proximos 10 anos bajo un nuevo plan decenal; (vi) Implementar un sistema integrado de informacion sanitaria, vinculando todos los subsistemas y niveles de asistencia, para basar la toma de decision; (vii) Fortalecer los mecanismos de fiscalizacion y control de las normativas laborales; (viii) Fortalecer los mecanismos de focalizacin del rgimen subsidiado.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(i) Implementing the separation of the functions of rectory and provision of the health sector; (ii) restructuring of the Dominican Institute of Social Security (IDSS); (iii) supporting the management by results of the health sector; (iv) eliminating the Contributive-Subsidized scheme; (v) defining the Dominican Government&apos;s priorities in the health sector within a ten-year franework; (vi) implementing an integrated health information system linking all subsystems and levels of care for supporting decision-making; (vii) strengthening the mechanisms for monitoring and control of labor regulations; (viii) enforcing the targeting mechanisms for the subsidized regime.</narrative>
  </description>
